    "context_text": "“Hey, Sara, have you finished the history homework?”\n“Not yet. I’ve been working on it since yesterday, but I still need to write the final paragraph.”\n“Do you want help? I already submitted mine this morning.”\n“That would be great, but I have to go to my piano lesson in ten minutes. Maybe after dinner?”\n“Sure, just text me when you’re free.”",
    "question": "Why can’t Sara receive help right now?",
