    "id": "EN-1726",
    "subject": "ingles",
    "context_text": "When Lucas arrived at the train station, he realized he had forgotten his wallet at home. He checked his backpack twice, hoping he had placed it in a different pocket, but it wasn’t there. Since he had already missed two morning trains this week, he didn’t want to be late again. Luckily, his friend Mia, who had been waiting for him, offered to pay for his ticket. Lucas promised he would return the money as soon as he got home after school.",
